    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself</strong> in a rich narrative, with meticulously detailed environments, horrific monsters, intricate, challenging puzzles and slow-burn psychological horror inspired by the classics.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lucas Hale, a retired police officer, as you find yourself picking up a paranormal investigation job. You've been told to explore the house of the missing CEO of PUPPETEERS Playplace, James Anderson. But when you step in to what used to be his house, you realize it is not what you signed up for.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/8fe87428c96ed56fa80d590628428de8.avif?t=1746613849\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on psychological horror. Forget a fetch quest filled P.T. clone. ENTWINE will keep you on the edge of your seat throughout your entire playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve various puzzles, explore through a forest, house, underground complex, police station and more. Slowly uncover the heartwrenching story behind Lucas Hale and dive deeper into the abandoned estate before being hunted down by the puppet himself.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/9a8511fae3caebc8b6b69dfb6c3f5f6a.avif?t=1746613849\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality, binaural sound powered by Steam Audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifyingly heavy and fresh take on psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations. Explore a forest, abandoned house, police station and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure isolation - no distracting NPCS or gimmicks. Just you and it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy focus on narrative. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and intricate puzzles - Inspired by Silent Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native controller / gamepad support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.poster.avif?t=1746613849\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.webm?t=1746613849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.mp4?t=1746613849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself</strong> in a rich narrative, with meticulously detailed environments, horrific monsters, intricate, challenging puzzles and slow-burn psychological horror inspired by the classics.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lucas Hale, a retired police officer, as you find yourself picking up a paranormal investigation job. You've been told to explore the house of the missing CEO of PUPPETEERS Playplace, James Anderson. But when you step in to what used to be his house, you realize it is not what you signed up for.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/8fe87428c96ed56fa80d590628428de8.avif?t=1746613849\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on psychological horror. Forget a fetch quest filled P.T. clone. ENTWINE will keep you on the edge of your seat throughout your entire playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve various puzzles, explore through a forest, house, underground complex, police station and more. Slowly uncover the heartwrenching story behind Lucas Hale and dive deeper into the abandoned estate before being hunted down by the puppet himself.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/9a8511fae3caebc8b6b69dfb6c3f5f6a.avif?t=1746613849\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality, binaural sound powered by Steam Audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifyingly heavy and fresh take on psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations. Explore a forest, abandoned house, police station and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure isolation - no distracting NPCS or gimmicks. Just you and it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy focus on narrative. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and intricate puzzles - Inspired by Silent Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native controller / gamepad support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.poster.avif?t=1746613849\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.webm?t=1746613849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.mp4?t=1746613849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
